        "email": "tsk@thesimplekid.com",
        "date": "2026-05-12T02:15:36Z"
      },
      "message": "fix: replace blocking Condvar pool with async Semaphore\n\nThe SQLite connection pool used std::sync::Condvar to wait for free connections, which blocks the OS thread.\nUnder the default pool size of 1, concurrent requests can block all Tokio worker threads, deadlocking the runtime\nthe task holding the connection can never be scheduled to release it.\nReplace with tokio::sync::Semaphore so waiters yield to the async runtime instead of blocking.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "33ef40660d9709bda4221e8965fe0a92e765d9b9",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/cashubtc/cdk/git/trees/33ef40660d9709bda4221e8965fe0a92e765d9b9"
      },
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/cashubtc/cdk/git/commits/128e68d42c94c54a5b6bdcef182258f14cfe5dba",
      "comment_count": 0,
      "verification": {
        "verified": true,
        "reason": "valid",
        "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niHUEABYKAB0WIQT7FBefWxISmS43iYljrW0Ju/53gwUCagKNSAAKCRBjrW0Ju/53\ng18tAPkB3b5OR6drtZhi8m6K2YR/a3E4zfGisA5ZjS259ve4CwD/XdtKYyOSmGam\nmGBCBEhdQZRZEjPkSUbnIjHUUg3iUwI=\n=F1cK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----",
        "payload": "tree 33ef40660d9709bda4221e8965fe0a92e765d9b9\nparent 586daed16075e8c42b21f0b7711df11bb147ea05\nauthor thesimplekid <tsk@thesimplekid.com> 1775051493 +0100\ncommitter thesimplekid <tsk@thesimplekid.com> 1778552136 -0400\nchange-id olwxwmqvsyxuyutzzmmulqytqvswqton\n\nfix: replace blocking Condvar pool with async Semaphore\n\nThe SQLite connection pool used std::sync::Condvar to wait for free connections, which blocks the OS thread.\nUnder the default pool size of 1, concurrent requests can block all Tokio worker threads, deadlocking the runtime\nthe task holding the connection can never be scheduled to release it.\nReplace with tokio::sync::Semaphore so waiters yield to the async runtime instead of blocking.\n",
        "verified_at": "2026-05-12T02:15:47Z"
      }
    },
